Earlier this week, I got an early look at the new Resident Evil movie and sat in on a live panel with director Zach Cregger. Instead of playing it safe, they brought actual survival horror tension back to Raccoon City. Watching the lead react exactly how an everyday gamer would if they were dropped into the nightmare completely changes the dynamic. You’re not going to want to miss this one. 

